{"id":18395,"name":"Beaver County","slug":"beaver-county","state":"Pennsylvania","code":"PA","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/pennsylvania-tax-deeds/beaver-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:52:37","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Upset Sale, Judicial Sale, Repository Sale","bidProcedure":"Highest Bidder Wins","contact":"Beaver County Assessment Office","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Upset Sale: Second Monday in September; Judicial Sale: Set by court"},{"label":"Registration Fee","value":"$25 Non-refundable"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Beaver County PA – Official Website"},{"label":"Assessment Office","value":"Beaver County Assessment Office"},{"label":"Tax Sale Information","value":"Beaver County Tax Sale Information"},{"label":"Repository Sale Info","value":"Sale of Property From The Repository"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Bid4Assets Beaver County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"36nROdfL8Pk9Yxdfpm07zZkNjg1LryTHPB0lqxb9BeCXEc7hsAcR38I4GWMg2CSGasuN\"><iframe title=\"Tax Sales Offer Huge Savings! - Beaver County - Pennsylvania Tax Deed Sale\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oViYfNKswzw?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Tax-Sales-Offer-Huge-Savings!---Beaver-County,-Pennsylvania-Tax-Deed-Sale\">Tax Sales Offer Huge Savings! &#8211; Beaver County, Pennsylvania Tax Deed Sale</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Unlock extraordinary savings on real estate by participating in Beaver County, Pennsylvania tax sales, where properties are auctioned for 40-90% below market value. The county conducts three types of sales: Upset Sale, Judicial Sale, and Repository Sale.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Beaver-County-Tax-Sale-Information\">Beaver County Tax Sale Information</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Types-of-Sales:\">Types of Sales:</h4>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Beaver</strong> <strong>County</strong> <strong>Upset Sale</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Date</strong>: Second Monday in September.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Details</strong>: Properties are sold with existing liens. Full payment of tax claims, interest, and costs can avoid the auction.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bidder Requirements</strong>: Registration ahead of time with a $25 non-refundable fee.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Beaver</strong> <strong>County</strong> <strong>Judicial Sale</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Date</strong>: Set by the court.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Details</strong>: Properties are sold free from taxes, liens, and encumbrances after a thorough title search.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Advertising</strong>: Requires extensive advertising for transparency.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bidder Requirements</strong>: Winning bidders cover transfer taxes and recording fees.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Beaver County</strong> <strong>Repository Sale</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Details</strong>: For properties unsold at the Judicial Sale, placed in the repository of unsold properties.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Requirements</strong>: Prospective purchasers must obtain consent from affected taxing authorities and agree to pay all associated costs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details-and-Links\">Important Details and Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/beaver-County-PA-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18398 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Beaver County PA courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Thoroughly</strong>: Understand local laws and regulations regarding tax sales.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Register Early</strong>: Ensure timely registration to avoid missing out on opportunities.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Prepare Finances</strong>: Be ready to cover additional costs like transfer taxes and recording fees.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">Beaver County Tax Sale FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What is a tax deed?</strong> <br>A: A tax deed grants ownership of a property to the purchaser of the tax lien if the original owner does not pay the owed taxes within a certain period.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I participate in Beaver County tax sales?</strong> <br>A: Register ahead of time, pay the registration fee, and follow the county&#8217;s auction guidelines. Check the county&#8217;s <a href=\"https://www.beavercountypa.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">official website</mark></a> for detailed information.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For more information, you can visit the <a href=\"https://www.beavercountypa.gov/departments/assessment-office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Beaver County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a> and <a href=\"https://www.beavercountypa.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Claim Overview &amp; Cost Schedule</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/pennsylvania-tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Seize Unbeatable Deals on Pennsylvania Properties with Tax Deed Auctions!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-investing-overview/understanding-tax-deed-investing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Let’s talk about Tax Deeds and how you can profit from them!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/ES5ZPyHRFMM?si=EmzhADUvwB_2FAAr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Discover Tax Deeds and how you can find property for as little as $50!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Ysq4_KdQSRg?si=SKw4Mg6hSnQBiDyN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Unlock incredible real estate deals by buying cheap houses with Pennsylvania tax deeds</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need assistance or guidance with tax lien investing, get our <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\"